<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Homes on</title><link>https://Kiran-Adhikari.github.io/home/</link><description>Recent content in Homes on</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><atom:link href="https://Kiran-Adhikari.github.io/home/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Home</title><link>https://Kiran-Adhikari.github.io/home/home/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://Kiran-Adhikari.github.io/home/home/</guid><description>&lt;section id="showcase" class="rad-showcase rad-showcase--index rad-animation-group rad-fade-down"&gt;&#10; &lt;div id="main-content"&gt;&#10; &#10;&#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &lt;div class="showcase-section row flex-column-reverse flex-md-row rad-fade-down rad-waiting rad-animate"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 col-xl-6"&gt;&#10; &lt;h1 class="display-1"&gt;&#10; Kiran Adhikari&#10; &lt;/h1&gt;&#10; &lt;h2 class="display-5"&gt;&#10; &lt;span&gt;Bioinformatics Scientist&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/h2&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="lead"&gt;&#10; I build production genomics pipelines and machine learning models that turn raw sequencing data into decisions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Day to day, I run &lt;strong&gt;NGS workflows&lt;/strong&gt; for RNA-seq, WGS, metagenomics, and DNA methylation on &lt;strong&gt;Nextflow&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Argo&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;Kubernetes&lt;/strong&gt;, and apply &lt;strong&gt;deep learning&lt;/strong&gt; to &lt;strong&gt;biomarker discovery&lt;/strong&gt; in liver disease.&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 col-xl-6 profile-image"&gt;&#10; &#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10; &#10; &#10;&#10;&#10;&#10; &#10; &#10;&#10;&#10; &lt;picture class=""&gt;&#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &lt;source srcset="https://Kiran-Adhikari.github.io/images/profile_hu_af461bcb352fe399.webp 1x, https://Kiran-Adhikari.github.io/images/profile_hu_6970aaa45fae46ba.webp 2x" type="image/webp" /&gt;&#10; &lt;source srcset="https://Kiran-Adhikari.github.io/images/profile_hu_d39302c0ff8b5099.png 1x, https://Kiran-Adhikari.github.io/images/profile_hu_46e7c083c244387d.png 2x" type="image/png"&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;img&#10; width="406"&#10; height="703"&#10; class="lozad img-responsive "&#10; data-src="https://Kiran-Adhikari.github.io/images/profile_hu_d39302c0ff8b5099.png"&#10; alt=''&#10; src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhBwACAIAAAP///wAAACH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAAHAAIAAAIDjI9YADs="&#10; loading="lazy"&#10; decoding="async"&#10; /&gt;&#10; &lt;/picture&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="col-12 inner-content"&gt;&#10; &#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;div class="container"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="row platform-links shortcode"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="col-12"&gt;&#10; &#10; &#10; &lt;a&#10; href="http://www.linkedin.com/in/kiran-adhikari-m1997"&#10; target="_blank"&#10; rel="noopener noreferrer"&#10; aria-label="linkedin"&#10; &gt;&lt;i class="icon-linkedin"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &lt;a&#10; href="https://github.com/Kiran-Adhikari"&#10; target="_blank"&#10; rel="noopener noreferrer"&#10; aria-label="square-github"&#10; &gt;&lt;i class="icon-square-github"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10; &lt;div class="row platform-links"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="col-12"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/section&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;section class="section home-focus"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="container"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="eyebrow"&gt;Focus&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="focus-grid"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="focus-card"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="focus-card__num"&gt;01&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;h3&gt;Pipelines&lt;/h3&gt;&#10; &lt;p&gt;Designing scalable, reproducible pipelines that process large-scale sequencing data, using Nextflow, Argo, Docker, and Kubernetes across HPC and cloud infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="focus-card"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="focus-card__num"&gt;02&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;h3&gt;Biomarkers&lt;/h3&gt;&#10; &lt;p&gt;Applying multi-omics analysis and machine learning to bulk and single-cell transcriptomic data to find disease-associated gene signatures that hold up across patient cohorts.&lt;/p&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="focus-card"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="focus-card__num"&gt;03&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;h3&gt;Long-term goal&lt;/h3&gt;&#10; &lt;p&gt;To become an independent scientist who integrates molecular and computational research to identify and validate therapeutic targets, advance drug discovery, and develop personalized treatments.&lt;/p&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/section&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>